---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Vuelta al Cole"
	description="Vuelta al Cole · Fragua47 — Nº 8, 5 de septiembre. Una educación estricta en disciplina... y en placer."
	ogImage="https://fragua47.org/vuelta-al-cole.webp"
>
	<div class="pagina-evento">

		<nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Ruta de navegación">
			<a href="/">Inicio</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
			<a href="/eventos/">Eventos</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
			<span aria-current="page">Vuelta al Cole</span>
		</nav>

		<div class="hero-evento frame-forja">
			<img src="/vuelta-al-cole.webp" alt="Vuelta al Cole" class="hero-img" />
		</div>

		<div class="ficha-evento panel-forja panel-forja--riveted">
			<p class="pre-titulo">— evento nº 8 —</p>
			<h1>Vuelta al Cole</h1>
			<p class="subtitulo">Una educación estricta en disciplina... y en placer.</p>
			<hr class="linea" />
			<div class="datos-evento">
				<div class="dato-fila">
					<span class="dato-label">
						<svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/></svg>
						Fecha
					</span>
					<span class="dato-valor">5 de Septiembre 2026 · Sábado</span>
				</div>
				<div class="dato-fila">
					<span class="dato-label">
						<svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M15 8.5a4 4 0 1 0 0 7"/><line x1="6.5" y1="10.5" x2="13" y2="10.5"/><line x1="6.5" y1="13.5" x2="13" y2="13.5"/></svg>
						Precio
					</span>
					<span class="dato-valor">25€ entrada</span>
				</div>
				<div class="dato-fila">
					<span class="dato-label">
						<svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 4h16v4a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-1a3 3 0 0 0-6 0H8a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V4z"/><path d="M6 20h12"/><path d="M12 12v8"/></svg>
						Dress code
					</span>
					<span class="dato-valor">Recomendable uniforme, fetish o mínimo negro</span>
				</div>
				<div class="dato-fila">
					<span class="dato-label">
						<svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
						Lugar
					</span>
					<span class="dato-valor dato-privado">Se indicará al confirmar asistencia</span>
				</div>
			</div>
			<hr class="linea" />
			<div class="footer-card">
				<a href="/eventos/" class="btn-forja btn-forja--outline">← Volver a eventos</a>
				<button class="btn-inscribete btn-forja" id="btn-inscribete">Inscríbete ⚒</button>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="tabs-evento panel-forja">
			<div class="tab-panel" id="panel-info" data-panel="info">
				<p>Nueva edición de nuestras fiestas temáticas: <strong>Vuelta al Cole</strong>, la número 8. Una noche de disciplina estricta... y de placer, para quienes disfrutan del juego de roles entre alumno/a y profesor/a.</p>

				<div class="bloque">
					<h3>Entrada</h3>
					<p><strong>25€</strong> por persona. Incluye picoteo y bebidas en barra durante toda la fiesta.</p>
				</div>

				<div class="bloque">
					<h3>Dress code</h3>
					<p>Se recomienda venir de uniforme (colegial, profesor/a...) o con estética fetish. Como mínimo, vestimenta en negro.</p>
				</div>

				<div class="bloque">
					<h3>Ubicación</h3>
					<p>La dirección exacta se enviará por privado a quienes confirmen su asistencia.</p>
				</div>

				<div class="bloque">
					<h3>Normas</h3>
					<p>Como en todos nuestros eventos, se aplican las <a href="/normas/">normas de la comunidad</a>. Consulta o participación siempre desde el consentimiento y el respeto.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

	</div>

	<!-- Modal inscripción -->
	<div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-overlay">
		<div class="modal-documento panel-forja panel-forja--doc">
			<button class="modal-cerrar" id="modal-cerrar" aria-label="Cerrar">✕</button>
			<div class="doc-header">
				<img src="/VectLogoF47.webp" alt="Logo Fragua47" class="modal-logo" width="300" height="343" />
				<h5>Inscripción</h5>
				<span class="doc-sello">⚒</span>
			</div>
			<p class="doc-sub">— VUELTA AL COLE · Fragua47 —</p>
			<hr class="doc-linea" />
			<form id="form-inscripcion">
				<div class="fila-campos">
					<div class="campo">
						<label for="correo-evento">Correo <span class="req">*</span></label>
						<input type="email" id="correo-evento" name="correo" required placeholder="tu@correo.com" />
					</div>
					<div class="campo">
						<label for="alias-evento">Alias <span class="req">*</span></label>
						<input type="text" id="alias-evento" name="alias" required placeholder="¿Cómo te conocemos?" />
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="campo">
					<label for="fetlife-evento">FetLife <span class="opcional">(opcional)</span></label>
					<input type="text" id="fetlife-evento" name="fetlife" placeholder="Tu nick en FetLife" />
				</div>
				<hr class="doc-linea" />
				<div class="doc-footer">
					<p class="form-msg" id="inscripcion-msg"></p>
					<button type="submit" id="inscripcion-btn" class="btn-enviar btn-forja">Enviar inscripción ⚒</button>
				</div>
			</form>
		</div>
	</div>

</Layout>

<script is:inline>
	// ── Modal ──
	const btn     = document.getElementById('btn-inscribete');
	const overlay = document.getElementById('modal-overlay');
	const cerrar  = document.getElementById('modal-cerrar');
	btn?.addEventListener('click', () => overlay.classList.add('abierto'));
	cerrar?.addEventListener('click', () => overlay.classList.remove('abierto'));
	overlay?.addEventListener('click', (e) => { if (e.target === overlay) overlay.classList.remove('abierto'); });
	document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
		if (e.key === 'Escape') overlay?.classList.remove('abierto');
	});

	document.getElementById('form-inscripcion')?.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
		e.preventDefault();
		const form = e.target;
		const ibtn = document.getElementById('inscripcion-btn');
		const msg  = document.getElementById('inscripcion-msg');
		ibtn.disabled = true; ibtn.textContent = 'Enviando...';
		msg.className = 'form-msg'; msg.textContent = '';
		const correo  = document.getElementById('correo-evento').value.trim();
		const alias   = document.getElementById('alias-evento').value.trim();
		const fetlife = document.getElementById('fetlife-evento').value.trim();
		const res = await fetch('/api/inscripcion', { method: 'POST', headers: {'Content-Type':'application/json'}, body: JSON.stringify({ correo, alias, fetlife }) });
		if (res.ok) {
			msg.className = 'form-msg ok';
			msg.textContent = '¡Inscripción enviada! Te confirmamos pronto.';
			form.reset();
		} else {
			msg.className = 'form-msg error';
			msg.textContent = 'Error al enviar. Inténtalo de nuevo.';
		}
		ibtn.disabled = false; ibtn.textContent = 'Enviar inscripción ⚒';
	});
</script>

<style>
	.pagina-evento {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 760px;
		margin: 1rem auto 2.5rem;
		font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
	}

	.breadcrumb {
		font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
		font-size: 0.67rem;
		color: #6a3010;
		margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.35rem;
		align-items: center;
	}
	.breadcrumb a { color: #6a3010; text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.2s; }
	.breadcrumb a:hover { color: #b44814; }
	.breadcrumb span[aria-current] { color: #3d2010; font-style: italic; }

	.hero-evento {
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 13 / 6;
		overflow: hidden;
		margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
	}

	.hero-img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		object-position: 50% 30%;
		display: block;
	}

	.ficha-evento {
		padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
	}

	.pre-titulo {
		font-size: 0.55rem;
		letter-spacing: 2.5px;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: #5a3018;
		margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	h1 {
		font-family: 'Metamorphous', cursive;
		font-size: 1.6rem;
		letter-spacing: 3px;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: #2a1208;
		margin: 0;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.subtitulo {
		font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
		font-style: italic;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		color: #6a2808;
		text-align: center;
		margin: 0.3rem 0 0;
	}

	.linea {
		border: none;
		border-top: 1.5px solid #2a1208;
		margin: 0.6rem 0;
	}

	.datos-evento {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0;
	}

	.dato-fila {
		display: flex;
		align-items: baseline;
		gap: 0.6rem;
		padding: 0.35rem 0;
	}

	.dato-fila + .dato-fila {
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(42,18,8,0.15);
	}

	.dato-label {
		font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
		font-size: 0.6rem;
		letter-spacing: 2px;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: #6a2808;
		font-weight: 700;
		min-width: 5.5rem;
		flex-shrink: 0;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.35rem;
	}

	.dato-label svg { width: 0.85rem; height: 0.85rem; flex-shrink: 0; }

	.dato-valor {
		font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
		color: #2a1208;
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.dato-privado { font-weight: 700; }

	.footer-card {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 0.6rem;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	/* ── Contenido ── */

	.tabs-evento { padding: 0; overflow: hidden; }

	.tab-panel {
		padding: 1.4rem 1.6rem 1.6rem;
	}

	.tab-panel p {
		font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
		color: #2a1208;
		margin: 0 0 0.7rem;
	}

	.tab-panel a { color: #6a2808; }

	.bloque { margin: 1.1rem 0; }
	.bloque:first-of-type { margin-top: 0.3rem; }

	.tab-panel h3 {
		font-family: 'Metamorphous', cursive;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		letter-spacing: 1.5px;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: #2a1208;
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
	}

	/* ── Modal (idéntico al de /eventos/) ── */

	.modal-overlay {
		display: none;
		position: fixed;
		inset: 0;
		background: rgba(20, 8, 2, 0.75);
		z-index: 500;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
	}
	.modal-overlay.abierto { display: flex; }

	.modal-documento {
		padding: 1.8rem 2rem;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 480px;
		font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
	}

	.modal-cerrar {
		position: absolute;
		top: 0.6rem;
		right: 0.8rem;
		background: none;
		border: none;
		font-size: 1rem;
		color: #2a1208;
		cursor: pointer;
		padding: 0;
	}
	.modal-cerrar:hover { color: #b44814; }

	.doc-header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 0.8rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
	}
	.modal-logo { height: 24px; width: auto; flex-shrink: 0; }
	.doc-sello { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 900; color: #b44814; letter-spacing: 2px; }

	h5 {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		letter-spacing: 4px;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: #2a1208;
		margin: 0;
		text-align: center;
		font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
	}

	.doc-sub {
		font-size: 0.55rem;
		letter-spacing: 1.5px;
		color: #5a3018;
		text-align: center;
		margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.doc-linea { border: none; border-top: 1.5px solid #2a1208; margin: 0.8rem 0; }
	.fila-campos { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
	.campo { display: flex; flex-direction: column; margin-bottom: 0.9rem; }

	label {
		font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
		font-size: 0.6rem;
		letter-spacing: 2px;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: #2a1208;
		margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
		font-weight: 700;
	}
	.req { color: #b44814; }
	.opcional {
		font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
		font-weight: 400;
		text-transform: none;
		letter-spacing: 0;
		color: #5a3018;
		font-size: 0.65rem;
	}

	input {
		background: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
		border: none;
		border-bottom: 1.5px solid #2a1208;
		padding: 0.4rem 0.3rem;
		font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		color: #1c0a02;
		outline: none;
		transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
	}
	input:focus { border-color: #b44814; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }
	input::placeholder { color: #7a5035; font-style: italic; font-size: 0.75rem; }

	.doc-footer { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 0.8rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
	.form-msg { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 0.72rem; margin: 0; }
	.form-msg.ok    { color: #2a6a1a; }
	.form-msg.error { color: #b41414; }

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.hero-evento { aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; }
		h1 { font-size: 1.25rem; }
		.dato-fila { flex-direction: column; gap: 0.15rem; }
		.dato-label { min-width: 0; }
		.tab-panel { padding: 1.2rem 1rem 1.4rem; }
		.fila-campos { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.modal-documento { margin: 1rem; }
	}

	::selection { background: rgba(180, 80, 20, 0.35); color: #ffe0b0; }
</style>
